SUMMARY:Haunted Hustle 5K\, Monster Dash\, and Wicked Walk
DESCRIPTION:The City of Gulf Shores turns Town Green and the public beach 
 into a Halloween evening with a costume parade\, a beach fun run\, and a 
 chip-timed 5K. The Wicked Walk starts at 6:00 PM\, the Monster Mash Dash 
 follows at 6:30 PM\, and the Haunted Hustle 5K goes off at 7:00 PM\, with
  games\, candy\, a live DJ\, and refreshments along the way. Registration
  fees rise closer to the event\, from $15 to $40 depending on the race an
 d how early you sign up\, and beer and wine are sold onsite for adults.\n
 Price: from $15\nArea: Orange Beach & Gulf Shores\nTimes: Saturday 10/17 
